---
layout: default
title: Friends I love to train with
---

<div class="page mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <header class="mb-16 max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="page-title mb-0 mt-0">Friends I love to train with.</h1>
  </header>

  <h2 id="phuket" class="page-display mb-10 mt-0 text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Phuket</h2>

  <div class="grid gap-20">
    <article class="friend grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] md:gap-10">
      <img src="/images/ben.jpg" alt="Benoit Piguet" width="463" height="462" loading="lazy" class="friend-photo">
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 mt-0 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Benoit Piguet</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-base font-bold"><a href="https://instagram.com/0xyben" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sky-700 no-underline hover:text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300 dark:hover:text-sky-200">@0xyben</a><span class="mx-2 text-slate-400">·</span><a href="https://namafreediving.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-slate-600 no-underline hover:text-slate-950 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-100">Nama Freediving</a></p>
        <ul class="home-creds">
          <li>Molchanovs Wave 3 Instructor Trainer</li>
          <li>Certified Yoga Instructor</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="page-prose">Twelve years travelling the world, and freediving is what made him stop and stay. Benoit found it on a trip to Thailand in 2019.</p>
        <p class="page-prose">Breath-hold and yoga together — the two practices lean on each other. Calm body, calm breath.</p>
        <p class="page-prose mb-0">On his days off he trains static, his favourite discipline.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="friend grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] md:gap-10">
      <img src="/images/court.jpg" alt="Court Burgon" width="799" height="799" loading="lazy" class="friend-photo">
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 mt-0 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Court Burgon</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-base font-bold"><a href="https://instagram.com/burgon_underwater" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sky-700 no-underline hover:text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300 dark:hover:text-sky-200">@burgon_underwater</a><span class="mx-2 text-slate-400">·</span><a href="https://namafreediving.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-slate-600 no-underline hover:text-slate-950 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-100">Nama Freediving</a></p>
        <ul class="home-creds">
          <li>Molchanovs Wave 2 Instructor</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="page-prose">A zoology degree, then Phuket in 2017 to work in the water. Over a thousand hours underwater as a scuba and freediving instructor taught Court the local reef and the ocean around it.</p>
        <p class="page-prose mb-0">Freediving, scuba and swimming, for adults and kids. Sessions run relaxed and safe.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="friend grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] md:gap-10">
      <img src="/images/victoria.jpg" alt="Victoria Fawcus-Robinson" width="1070" height="2400" loading="lazy" class="friend-photo">
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 mt-0 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Victoria Fawcus-Robinson</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-base font-bold"><a href="https://instagram.com/barefootblondiephuket" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sky-700 no-underline hover:text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300 dark:hover:text-sky-200">@barefootblondiephuket</a><span class="mx-2 text-slate-400">·</span><a href="https://scubanicks.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-slate-600 no-underline hover:text-slate-950 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-100">ScubaNicks</a></p>
        <ul class="home-creds">
          <li>SSI Senior Instructor</li>
          <li>Freediving Instructor</li>
          <li>Mermaid Instructor</li>
          <li>SSI Scuba Explorer Instructor (kids)</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="page-prose">Victoria came to the water in 2015 and went pro in 2018. She is now Senior Instructor at ScubaNicks in Rawai, teaching every level up to dive professional.</p>
        <p class="page-prose mb-0">Freediving, scuba and mermaid — she moves easily between them. She has the patience for kids and first-time divers, and she stays right beside them in the water.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="friend grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] md:gap-10">
      <img src="/images/tony.jpg" alt="Tony Myshlyaev" width="532" height="530" loading="lazy" class="friend-photo">
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 mt-0 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Tony Myshlyaev</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-base font-bold"><a href="https://instagram.com/tones.of.blue" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sky-700 no-underline hover:text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300 dark:hover:text-sky-200">@tones.of.blue</a><span class="mx-2 text-slate-400">·</span><a href="https://namafreediving.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-slate-600 no-underline hover:text-slate-950 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-100">Nama Freediving</a></p>
        <ul class="home-creds">
          <li>Molchanovs Wave 3 Instructor</li>
          <li>Underwater photographer</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="page-prose">Thirteen years in the water and a camera. Tony taught freediving on Koh Tao for seven years before moving to Phuket in 2022.</p>
        <p class="page-prose mb-0">The camera shows up in the coaching — body position, movement, efficiency. He works with divers of every level.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <h2 id="bali" class="page-display mb-10 mt-20 text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Bali</h2>

  <div class="grid gap-20">
    <article class="friend grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] md:gap-10">
      <img src="/images/yan.jpg" alt="Yan Tychkovskyi" width="960" height="960" loading="lazy" class="friend-photo">
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 mt-0 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Yan Tychkovskyi</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-base font-bold"><a href="https://www.balifreedivers.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sky-700 no-underline hover:text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300 dark:hover:text-sky-200">Bali Freedivers</a><span class="mx-2 text-slate-400">·</span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/balifreedivers.amed" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-slate-600 no-underline hover:text-slate-950 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-100">@balifreedivers.amed</a><span class="mx-2 text-slate-400">·</span><span class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Amed</span></p>
        <ul class="home-creds">
          <li>SSI Level 3</li>
          <li>Molchanovs</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="page-prose">In the water since he was five. Yan is Ukrainian, moved to Indonesia in 2013, and has taught across five countries and more than five hundred students since.</p>
        <p class="page-prose mb-0">Runs Bali Freedivers in Amed, mostly with beginners. Sessions follow what you do in the water — spearfishing, surfing — with the breathwork and safety skills that hold up when it gets tight.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <h2 id="moscow" class="page-display mb-10 mt-20 text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Moscow</h2>

  <div class="grid gap-20">
    <article class="friend grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] md:gap-10">
      <img src="/images/roman.jpg" alt="Roman Garaikhanov" width="700" height="1120" loading="lazy" class="friend-photo">
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 mt-0 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Roman Garaikhanov</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-base font-bold"><a href="https://instagram.com/roman_gara" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sky-700 no-underline hover:text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300 dark:hover:text-sky-200">@roman_gara</a><span class="mx-2 text-slate-400">·</span><a href="https://molchanova.school" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-slate-600 no-underline hover:text-slate-950 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-100">Molchanova Freediving School</a></p>
        <ul class="home-creds">
          <li>Molchanovs Wave 3 Instructor</li>
          <li>Molchanovs Kids Instructor L1 &amp; L2</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="page-prose">In the water since childhood. Roman swam for his city team in competition before freediving took over.</p>
        <p class="page-prose">A competing freediver, still refining his own dives while coaching. Certified to teach both adults (Wave 3) and kids (L1 &amp; L2) in the Molchanovs system, and an experienced safety diver and coach.</p>
        <p class="page-prose mb-0">Organises the amateur <em>I love freediving</em> competitions and works as sports manager at the Natalia Molchanova Freediving School.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="friend grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] md:gap-10">
      <img src="/images/artur.jpg" alt="Artur Tikhonov" width="912" height="1332" loading="lazy" class="friend-photo">
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-1 mt-0 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Artur Tikhonov</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-base font-bold"><a href="https://instagram.com/artur_tichonov" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sky-700 no-underline hover:text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300 dark:hover:text-sky-200">@artur_tichonov</a><span class="mx-2 text-slate-400">·</span><a href="https://molchanova.school" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-slate-600 no-underline hover:text-slate-950 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-100">Molchanova Freediving School</a></p>
        <ul class="home-creds">
          <li>Molchanovs Wave 2 Instructor</li>
          <li>Freediving rescue &amp; first aid</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="page-prose">A competing finswimmer turned freediving instructor. Artur has won national underwater-sport titles in both bi-fins and monofin.</p>
        <p class="page-prose mb-0">Personal bests: 248 m bi-fins, 227 m monofin, 161 m breaststroke, and a 7:24 static. Wave 1 and Wave 2 courses in the pool, certified freediving rescue and first-aid specialist.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</div>
